  "description": "A next-generation, attribute-driven REST client framework for .NET designed for enterprise-grade resiliency, observability, multi-serialization, caching, and fault tolerance.\n\t\t\tProvides Refit-style interfaces with powerful enhancements such as Polly-based resilience policies, OpenTelemetry integration, interceptor pipeline, typed fallbacks, dynamic content negotiation, and unified DI registration.\n\t\t\tIdeal for building robust API SDKs, microservice clients, and production-grade integrations.",
